      "text": "Private endpoints / DNS + managed identities / scoped RBAC\nSearch identity reads ONLY approved + reviewed-evidence containers\nSearch-to-Blob and CU processing / billing shared links need approval\nExisting AI / network owners remain authoritative; no Fabric source\nSolid arrows: application / evidence flow; dashed: identity / platform",
