      "text": "Processing and readiness gates | target design, NOT a deployment or certification claim\nApproved US region / model geography or dataZone; separately approve native layout processing\nExact image, platform and TLS cryptographic evidence + private synthetic acceptance required\nPrivate endpoints, FIPS node flags and build pools alone are insufficient; service policies still apply",
